# Known items - Batch 1
items.Bench_Alchemy_Known.description = Used to create potions and elixirs.\n\n<i>The alchemists of old long sought the secrets to eternal life. Some might say they achieved that grand goal, though perhaps not in the form they imagined.</i>\n\nElements:\nSilicon (40%)\nIron (25%)\nCopper (20%)\nPhosphorus (15%)
items.Bench_Arcane_Known.description = Used to fashion various arcane implements.\n\n<i>The arcane arts are the closest mere mortals have ever come to achieving Avatar powers. Had they mastered them sooner, perhaps they would not have been so easily swayed.</i>\n\nElements:\nSilicon (35%)\nOxygen (25%)\nGold (20%)\nEuropium (20%)
items.Bench_Armour_Known.description = Used to craft basic armor.\n\nElements:\nIron (50%)\nCarbon (20%)\nSilicon (20%)\nChromium (10%)
items.Bench_Builders_Known.description = Used to create structural building blocks.\n\nElements:\nCarbon (45%)\nOxygen (30%)\nSilicon (15%)\nIron (10%)
items.Bench_Campfire_Known.description = Cook basic meals.\n\n<i>To many an adventurer, the humble campfire is all it takes to declare a place "home." Unshakeable bonds can be forged while basking in its warmth and all great tales have sparked from its embers.</i>\n\nElements:\nCarbon (60%)\nOxygen (20%)\nHydrogen (10%)\nPotassium (10%)
items.Bench_Cooking_Known.description = A built-in kitchen that can be used to make advanced dishes.\n\nElements:\nIron (45%)\nSilicon (30%)\nCarbon (15%)\nChromium (10%)
items.Bench_Farming_Known.description = Used to craft farming accessories and animal feed.\n\nElements:\nCarbon (45%)\nOxygen (30%)\nSilicon (15%)\nNitrogen (10%)
items.Bench_Furnace_Known.description = Used to process ore into metal bars. Upgrading reduces smelting times and increases storage capacity.\n\nElements:\nSilicon (40%)\nOxygen (30%)\nIron (20%)\nCalcium (10%)
items.Bench_Furniture_Known.description = Used to craft furniture, storage, and decorative items to personalize your home.\n\nElements:\nCarbon (50%)\nOxygen (25%)\nIron (15%)\nSilicon (10%)
items.Bench_Lumbermill_Known.description = Elements:\nIron (50%)\nCarbon (30%)\nTungsten (15%)\nOxygen (5%)
items.Bench_Memories_Known.description = <i>A faint disembodied voice can be heard in the presence of this statue. Echoes of a being from beyond the barriers. From the original world.</i>\n\nElements:\nGold (30%)\nOxygen (25%)\nSilicon (25%)\nEuropium (20%)
items.Bench_Salvage_Known.description = Can be used to break down some items into base materials.\n\nElements:\nIron (45%)\nCarbon (30%)\nSilicon (15%)\nMolybdenum (10%)
items.Bench_Tannery_Known.description = Used to process raw hides into leather. Upgrading reduces processing times and increases storage capacity.\n\nElements:\nCarbon (55%)\nOxygen (25%)\nIron (10%)\nChromium (10%)
items.Bench_Trough_Known.description = Used to craft farming accessories and animal feed.\n\nElements:\nCarbon (55%)\nOxygen (25%)\nIron (10%)\nHydrogen (10%)
items.Bench_Weapon_Known.description = Used to fashion basic weaponry.\n\nElements:\nIron (70%)\nCarbon (15%)\nChromium (10%)\nNickel (5%)
items.Bench_WorkBench_Known.description = A workstation enabling the crafting of more complex tools and items.\n\n<i>No artisan is born a creator. Even Avatars need time to hone their craft, particularly when bound by the rules of another's domain.</i>\n\nElements:\nCarbon (60%)\nOxygen (25%)\nIron (10%)\nHydrogen (5%)
